## Net effect

Operator surface: ~27 → **17 keep + 1 derive-override**. Rest deletes (6 incl. never-introduced ROOT), hides (2), or is dead (4). CWD-anchoring adds ZERO new vars. `SLAYZONE_HUB_` rename touches only 3 live hub-only vars (hub pkg blast radius).

Deploy collapses to:
- **Hub:** `SLAYZONE_HUB_RUNNER_TRANSPORT_SECRET` (auto-gen) + optional port/host/public-url
- **Runner:** `SLAYZONE_JOIN_TOKEN` + `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_ALLOWED_ROOTS`

**CWD-anchored (bold standalone default) = the 3 this task retargets:** `SLAYZONE_HOME_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_STORE_DIR`, `SLAYZONE_RUNNER_CREDENTIALS_DIR` (+ raw-homedir credential-store gap to fix).

⚠️ All delete/derive/hide/rename = behavior/code changes, SEPARATE from the CWD-anchoring task.
